      "text": "Find what stops tests running (no test runs yet)\nunder-test-external-calls and draft-the-external-systems-list:\nthe external systems, and each test that reaches one, graded\nfind-meaningless-and-unreliable-tests: tests that check nothing,\nand tests that sleep or depend on order",
